# Check text files out with LF on every platform.
#
# This is not cosmetic. A SKILL.md checked out with CRLF put a `\r` at the end of every YAML
# frontmatter line, and the plugin loader's YAML parser rejected the file - so the skill loaded with
# *empty metadata*, silently, and only in someone else's clone. It validated here and failed there.
# Normalising the checkout means what is published is what was tested.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.bundle binary
